# Line-ending policy: text files are stored in the repository with LF and checked out with LF
# on every OS, whatever each machine's core.autocrlf setting is. Git detects binary files
# automatically (text=auto); the common binary types below are listed explicitly so they are
# never normalized.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.zip   binary
